WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:15.218
ANC Venue Showroom connects creative preparation with a sales presentation. Start in Prepare. Choose the venue and displays, then apply an ANC creative, your own video, or a logo to one screen or all active screens.

2
00:00:15.718 --> 00:00:29.798
Open Projects, name the experience, and add the client or campaign. Save project and media stores the venue settings and uploaded files together. The saved version is ready to reopen later.

3
00:00:30.298 --> 00:00:44.065
All projects is your workspace library. Open a project to continue preparing it, or use Present on a published project. Archive keeps a project out of use and pauses its presentation link; Restore makes it available again.

4
00:00:44.565 --> 00:00:55.745
When the experience is ready, choose Share. Publish and copy the presentation link. The published version stays separate from your draft. Publish again when you want sales and clients to see your latest changes.

5
00:00:56.245 --> 00:01:08.993
This is the sales presentation. Your recipient sees the project and client name, audience views, the camera tour, and playback controls. They can explore the experience without editing the prepared project.

6
00:01:09.493 --> 00:01:23.181
In Projects, open Workspace to copy your workspace access link. Keep this link private: it gives editing access to every project in this workspace and lets you reopen them on another device. Give clients the presentation link from Share.

